WEBVTT

00:04:48.208 --> 00:04:50.458
The fog won't descend.

00:09:58.250 --> 00:09:59.083
Are you okay?

00:10:00.125 --> 00:10:01.875
Haruo! Please get away!

00:10:02.125 --> 00:10:03.542
Wait, Yuko. Calm down!

00:10:04.042 --> 00:10:07.708
Captain Sakaki,
we were just under attack by that.

00:17:39.167 --> 00:17:41.583
The Passing Crows are not wings of death.

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:54.375
What is this place?

00:34:06.875 --> 00:34:08.958
Earth chose Godzilla?

00:34:09.708 --> 00:34:13.042
<i>Pollution and global warming
<i>due to carbon dioxide,</i></i>

00:34:13.333 --> 00:34:16.792
<i>and the multiple nuclear tests
<i>conducted because of the armaments race.</i></i>

00:36:53.625 --> 00:36:57.875
On this planet that Godzilla rules,
and even after losing its master,

00:36:57.958 --> 00:37:01.667
our Mechagodzilla
had been continuing to fight.

00:44:11.833 --> 00:44:16.708
If we had all this,
then even if it's Godzilla...

00:44:22.792 --> 00:44:26.292
<i>Wait, Captain Sakaki.
<i>Do you still intend to fight Godzilla?</i></i>

00:55:24.375 --> 00:55:27.958
And there, we discerned our mission.

00:58:43.208 --> 00:58:47.417
Compared to that,
Godzilla would not even be worth the fear.

00:59:38.167 --> 00:59:39.750
Yeah, probably.

00:59:40.833 --> 00:59:43.958
I'm jealous that you know about
the past Earth.

00:59:44.708 --> 00:59:47.625
I was just a kid,
so I don't remember much.

01:02:20.792 --> 01:02:24.000
<i>The land howls.
<i>The Burning Mountain will rise.</i></i>

01:02:24.667 --> 01:02:28.167
<i>That breath is a storm,
<i>that rage is thunder.</i></i>

01:11:45.500 --> 01:11:46.333
<i>-Roger.
<i>-Roger.</i></i>

01:11:47.958 --> 01:11:49.875
All Vultures, launch!

01:14:58.917 --> 01:15:01.250
<i>Diversion on track,
<i>800 meters to the trap point.</i></i>

01:15:02.500 --> 01:15:04.958
<i>All trap sections
<i>operations system check complete.</i></i>

01:15:05.542 --> 01:15:06.750
<i>Activation prepared.</i>

01:15:07.917 --> 01:15:10.417
First harpoon, error from the final check.

01:15:10.625 --> 01:15:13.750
What?
But Godzilla is almost at the trap point!

01:15:14.208 --> 01:15:16.000
-What should we do?
-Haruo!

01:17:26.750 --> 01:17:27.667
Ready to fire.

01:17:28.000 --> 01:17:28.833
They made it.

01:17:29.917 --> 01:17:31.333
Of course, we're Bilusaludo.

01:17:31.625 --> 01:17:35.000
Don’t let it notice the harpoons.
Keep its attention.

01:17:35.083 --> 01:17:36.750
-Roger.
-Roger.

01:23:06.125 --> 01:23:07.708
<i>We'd get burned alive.</i>

01:23:08.333 --> 01:23:11.125
<i>Room temperature steadily rising,
<i>becoming unmanageable.</i></i>

01:23:11.500 --> 01:23:13.208
<i>Control, what's going on!</i>

01:24:47.792 --> 01:24:49.083
We can't get any closer.
